      "clinical_diagnosis_basis": "Whole-exome sequencing with CNV analysis of WES data (EXCAVATOR2) and genome-wide SNP array (Infinium Asian Screening Array-24 v1.0) showing a de novo 119 kb microdeletion involving only TNFAIP3; no homozygous IL10/IL10R variants. Oral aphthous ulcers, arthritis and intestinal punched-out ulcers did not fulfill criteria for complete or incomplete Behçet disease.",
